WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.820
Suicide Squad is finally here, bringing us
the worst bunch of heroes to ever hit the

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.910
silver screen.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:15.140
Now it's time to discuss what the ending of
the film means for DC’s movie franchise.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:19.949
That is, if it can survive the rough reviews
and actually still get a sequel.

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:21.390
Spoilers ahead!.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:22.390
New Squad

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:27.749
In the final act, our heroic band of villains
spared the world from destruction, and one

00:00:27.749 --> 00:00:29.740
didn’t make it out alive.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:35.460
Even after the Squad saved the day, Amanda
Waller only took 10 years off their sentences,

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.000
so it was back to prison for the crew.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.890
Thankfully, the Squad has a history of revolving
members, so we could definitely see some new

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.570
blood in a sequel.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:50.879
The team's included the likes of Killer Frost,
Parasite, Doctor Light, and even The Penguin.

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:56.309
With El Diablo dead and Harley Quinn freed
by the Joker, there are some slots to fill.

00:00:56.309 --> 00:01:01.000
Here's hoping for a gigantic CGI King Shark.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.820
Harley Quinn's Misadventures

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:07.240
Beyond potentially appearing in a Suicide
Squad sequel, Harley Quinn will reportedly

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:12.500
be getting her own movie, so expect to see
the mallet-wielding psycho return.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.650
Even though the Joker busted her out of prison
at the end of Suicide Squad, we're hoping

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:21.630
Harley can spread her wings without being
tethered to the Clown Prince of Crime.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:27.930
Her spinoff could include the return of Katana...or
maybe her longtime partner in crime, Poison

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.160
Ivy, perhaps?

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.400
Waller’s End

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:35.360
Amanda Waller is a character who quickly asserts
herself as a force to be reckoned with.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:41.610
As a master manipulator, she does what's necessary
to serve her own agenda, including killing

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.780
innocents to protect her interests.

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:48.210
She's threatened every member of the Suicide
Squad, including Rick Flagg.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:53.591
In the animated film Assault on Arkham, Deadshot
makes sure that Waller knows that he has the

00:01:53.591 --> 00:01:54.591
upper hand.

00:01:54.591 --> 00:01:59.140
There's no love lost between these two, so
it's possible that we could see that story

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:02.390
advance in a Suicide Squad sequel.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.730
Justice

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:08.350
If you stuck around long enough to watch the
mid-credits scene, you were treated to a faceoff

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.470
between Waller and Bruce Wayne.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:16.480
Waller wanted protection from the media and
gave Wayne some dossiers of metahumans in

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:17.480
return.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.900
The two had a tense exchange toward the end
of the scene, with Waller implying that she

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.739
knows Bruce Wayne is Batman.

00:02:24.739 --> 00:02:28.120
If there's one thing Waller is good at, it's
getting leverage.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:33.969
What would happen if the Justice League had
shut down Task Force X?

00:02:33.969 --> 00:02:36.180
Deadshot And Harley forever

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:41.120
In the comics, Deadshot and Harley Quinn enjoyed
a turbulent and short-lived romance.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:46.989
Meanwhile, the chemistry between Will Smith
and Margot Robbie is hard to miss, and a relationship

00:02:46.989 --> 00:02:49.629
could potentially be explored in a sequel.

00:02:49.629 --> 00:02:54.650
After all, Deadshot purposely missed his shot
at Harley, giving up the chance to see his

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.650
daughter.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:59.219
If that doesn't scream "I like you!" then
nothing does.

00:02:59.219 --> 00:03:00.810
The Return Of Katana

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:05.840
Katana was on hand to help Rick Flagg keep
the villains in line, but we only saw a little

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.989
bit of her backstory and soul-stealing sword.

00:03:08.989 --> 00:03:13.170
She's rumored to return in Harley's spinoff
film, but whether she comes back as friend

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.370
or foe is up in the air.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:19.980
We'd like to think she'd be sent by Waller
to bring Quinn back to prison, but we'd also

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.639
love to see a Katana and Harley team-up.

00:03:22.639 --> 00:03:24.680
“She seems nice.”

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:25.680
Thanks for watching!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.640
Subscribe to our YouTube channel to watch
more videos like the one you just saw.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.819
And leave us a comment to let us know what
you think could happen in the Suicide Squad’s

00:03:33.819 --> 00:03:34.230
future…

